{
  "info": {
    "name": "GreenLight API",
    "description": "GreenLight: Red comunitaria de reporte de quemas y focos de humo (Flask + Supabase).\n\nCómo usarla:\n1) Importar esta colección.\n2) Base correcta: {{base_url}} = http://localhost:5000/api (ya viene así).\n3) Ejecutar en orden las carpetas: '2. Autenticación' (hace login y guarda los tokens), luego '3. Feed y reportes' y '4. Estadísticas y catálogos'.\nLos IDs se guardan solos al ejecutar cada request (reporte_id, usuario_id, comunidad_id, tipo_id). María crea, Carlos confirma, el coordinador verifica.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:5000/api" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "token_maria", "value": "" },
    { "key": "token_carlos", "value": "" },
    { "key": "usuario_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "reporte_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "comunidad_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "tipo_id", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check (/api/health)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/health" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Salud (/api/salud - healthcheck Render)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/salud" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Swagger (/api/docs - documentación)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "http://localhost:5000/api/docs" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Autenticación (tokens automáticos)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (coordinador)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"correo\": \"coordinador@greenlight.test\", \"contraseña\": \"Coordi123!\" }"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (María)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token_maria', json.token);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"correo\": \"maria@greenlight.test\", \"contraseña\": \"Vecino123!\" }"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Carlos)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token_carlos', json.token);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"correo\": \"carlos@greenlight.test\", \"contraseña\": \"Vecino123!\" }"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mi perfil (me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar usuarios (coord)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/usuarios"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Registro (nuevo usuario)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('nuevo_correo', 'nueva' + Date.now() + '@greenlight.test');"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.usuario) pm.collectionVariables.set('usuario_id', json.usuario.id);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"nombre\": \"Vecina Nueva\", \"correo\": \"{{nuevo_correo}}\", \"contraseña\": \"Vecino123!\" }"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/registro"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cambiar rol de usuario (coord)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"rol\": \"coordinador\" }"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/usuarios/{{usuario_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar usuario (coord)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/usuarios/{{usuario_id}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Feed y reportes (María crea, Carlos confirma)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Feed completo",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/feed" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear reporte (María)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('reporte_id', json.id);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_maria}}" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"tipo_id\": 2, \"comunidad_id\": null, \"ubicacion_texto\": \"Vereda El Roble, km 4\", \"descripcion\": \"Humo denso saliendo del monte.\" }"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/reportes"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener reporte",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/reportes/{{reporte_id}}" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar reporte (María)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_maria}}" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"descripcion\": \"Humo muy denso, pide apoyo.\" }"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/reportes/{{reporte_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Confirmar reporte (Carlos)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_carlos}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/reportes/{{reporte_id}}/confirmar"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cambiar estado a verificado (coord)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"estado\": \"verificado\" }"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/reportes/{{reporte_id}}/estado"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Sync offline (María)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_maria}}" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"reportes\": [ { \"tipo_id\": 1, \"descripcion\": \"Reporte creado sin conexión\", \"ubicacion_texto\": \"Zona rural\" } ], \"confirmaciones\": [] }"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/sync"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar reporte (coord)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/reportes/{{reporte_id}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Estadísticas y catálogos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Stats",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/stats" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Comunidades",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/comunidades" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear comunidad (coord)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('comunidad_id', json.id);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"nombre\": \"Comunidad Demo\", \"zona_ciudad\": \"Zona Norte\" }"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/comunidades"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar comunidad (coord)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/comunidades/{{comunidad_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Tipos de incidente",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/tipo-incidentes" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear tipo (coord)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('tipo_id', json.id);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"nombre\": \"Quema Urbana\", \"descripcion\": \"Fuego en zonas urbanas.\", \"icono\": \"🏠\", \"color_etiqueta\": \"#f05a00\" }"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/tipo-incidentes"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar tipo (coord)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/tipo-incidentes/{{tipo_id}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Seguridad JWT (401/403)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sin token -> 401",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Sin token responde 401', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Token alterado -> 401",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Token alterado responde 401', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}x" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ruta de coordinador como usuario común -> 403",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Ruta exclusiva de coordinador responde 403', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_maria}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/usuarios"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}